{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Lvyi7iyqJu1792646005.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一隻野豬早上闖入維園，警方與漁護署人員花了四小時將牠捕獲。</p><p></p><p>野豬長約一米，在維園小食亭附近草叢徘徊。警方最先在7時許接報，有人發現野豬在近天后的小山丘出沒，通知漁護署協助處理，警員手持盾牌戒備。</p><p></p><p>漁護署職員到場後，在現場掛起圍網等，再用麻醉槍協助捕捉野豬，最終在近10時，將該隻野豬搬上客貨車送走，期間無人被攻擊或受傷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T07:22:14.499844+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T07:17:55.207409+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:17:55.207409+00:00","content_hash":"76e3e587b35abcd39573d106b2a6a28fed2b1fa8397cc832c2c50f917d2c2ce8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}